jurisdictional determination(AJD)request.We assume the ditch will receive a non-
jurisdictional determination and the maintenance may move forward without addition
Section404permitting.
2.Dell Range Drainage Ditch: WESTwill coordinate with the Cityof Cheyenne, AVI, and
the USACE to permit maintenance dredging activities along an approximately 800-foot
stretch of Meadow land Ditch.The current approach has identified Nationwide Permit 3-
Maintenance as the preferred route.Fairly basic materials will need to be developed for
preparation and submission of thepre-construction notification(PCN).
3.Dry Creek: WESTwill coordinate with the City of Cheyenne(City), AVl, and theUSACE
Creek.The current approach has identified Nationwide Permit 27-Aquatic Habitat
This approach will require development of additional materials(fromWEST, City, and AVI)
